1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,530
Na aula de hoje

2
00:00:00,530 --> 00:00:01,550
você vai aprender

3
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:02,530
a fazer o drop set.

4
00:00:02,530 --> 00:00:02,700
Como que a gente

5
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:03,480
faz o drop set?

6
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:04,620
Primeiro, você vai colocar

7
00:00:04,620 --> 00:00:05,380
o peso na máquina

8
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,730
o máximo que você aguenta.

9
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:07,280
Por exemplo,

10
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:08,580
vamos supor que eu

11
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:09,420
aguente 50 quilos,

12
00:00:09,420 --> 00:00:10,380
eu vou botar na máquina

13
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,100
50 quilos.

14
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:11,740
Agora eu vou fazer

15
00:00:11,740 --> 00:00:12,800
10 repetições.

16
00:00:12,870 --> 00:00:13,220
Normal,

17
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:14,250
sobe com força

18
00:00:14,250 --> 00:00:15,230
e volta devagar,

19
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:15,900
sem correr.

20
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:16,880
Fiz as 10 repetições,

21
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:18,010
sem descansar,

22
00:00:18,010 --> 00:00:18,830
eu vou abaixar

23
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,030
10 quilos na máquina,

24
00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:20,440
ou seja,

25
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:21,280
eu vou botar 40.

26
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:22,430
Faço novamente mais 10.

27
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:22,800
Lembre-se,

28
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,600
sem descansar.

29
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:24,270
Mesma coisa,

30
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:24,940
sobe com força,

31
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:25,960
volta devagar

32
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:26,700
sem correr,

33
00:00:26,700 --> 00:00:27,500
concentrado.

34
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:28,060
Fiz as 10,

35
00:00:28,060 --> 00:00:29,060
vou abaixar novamente

36
00:00:29,060 --> 00:00:29,800
para 30.

37
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:31,350
Faço novamente mais 10.

38
00:00:34,250 --> 00:00:35,060
Agora sim, acabei,

39
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:35,900
eu vou descansar

40
00:00:35,900 --> 00:00:36,580
1 minuto.

41
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:37,590
Isso foi uma série

42
00:00:37,590 --> 00:00:38,500
de drop set.

43
00:00:38,570 --> 00:00:39,160
Se sua ficha

44
00:00:39,160 --> 00:00:40,010
tiver escrito

45
00:00:40,010 --> 00:00:41,640
"drop set 3 séries",

46
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:42,090
você vai fazer

47
00:00:42,090 --> 00:00:43,360
todo esse processo

48
00:00:43,360 --> 00:00:44,300
3 vezes.
